{
  "bodyHash": "eabc43accb77e819",
  "content": "\n\nPlease provide the text you'd like me to translate into zh-TW.\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wyi1b9n.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Pxj3gdhGj8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_a255b953-62ec-43d7-b4b3-8a1a94b36bac.png\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knight-quest-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_7238dacb-7d9b-4a20-bbd7-b4fb918fb938.png\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knight-quest-reforged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_d108d080-9787-40f4-9eab-b5a715e7826b.png\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_1b32b3dd-8aa3-4fa4-b6f4-d7c186884e91.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>Knight Quest</strong> 是一個模組，新增超過 30 套護甲，每套皆具備被動能力、擁有獨特技能的敵對生物、新武器、可馴服的生物、三階段首領，以及更多內容。本模組圍繞著一個名為<em>偉大聖杯</em>的方塊展開，必須用<em>偉大精華</em>將其填滿（由擊敗怪物獲得的 4 個小型精華合製而成）。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>本模組與 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Better Combat</a> 及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Epic Fight</a></strong> 高度相容，強烈建議搭配使用。後者需下載 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-knight-quest-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Epic Fight x Knight Quest Compatibility</a></strong> 資源包。</p>\n<p>若你想屏蔽特定物品，強烈建議安裝 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/item-obliterator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Item Obliterator</a> </strong>模組。例如，若想防止遊戲中出現本模組的所有護甲，可利用此模組進行屏蔽。針對生物屏蔽的替代方案為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/you-shall-not-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>You Shall Not Spawn</strong></a>。</p>\n<p>同時推薦安裝 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">JEI</a> </strong>模組，方便查看所有物品的合成配方。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模組透過設定檔提供<strong>高度可自訂</strong>的選項。如有任何問題、建議、貢獻、新內容/模組構想等，歡迎加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/Pxj3gdhGj8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">官方 Discord</a> 並在對應頻道留言。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MuITIRg.png\" width=\"65%\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>偉大聖杯</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_24d5c0c9-d2a6-4e36-9a30-ee6f71ba8bcc.png\" width=\"170\" height=\"188\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">它是本模組的<strong>核心道具</strong>。合成方式類似煉藥釜，但使用銅錠。其主要功能是製作「<em>盛滿酒杯</em>」道具。玩家可以透過互動（右鍵點擊）使用<em>偉大精華</em>來填充此方塊。當它完全充滿後，可用來將<em>空酒杯</em>裝滿，作為本模組大多數物品的合成材料；或可與輝耀精華互動召喚首領<em>奈瑟曼，混沌建築師</em>；亦可與<strong>混沌精華</strong>互動來啟動武器的能力。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BqlQBkn.png\" width=\"60%\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>小型精華</strong></h3>\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_ae1ab772-8a02-4d54-8294-b12d24e8a655.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"151\"></h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>小型精華</strong>是一種特殊道具，由原版生物與本模組生物掉落，掉落機率可於設定檔中調整。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>偉大精華</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_02b4964d-bc04-47ee-a68a-bd24a1c457ff.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>偉大精華</strong>是本模組的主要道具，可在工作檯中將 4 個小型精華以正方形排列合製而成。用於透過互動（右鍵點擊）填充偉大聖杯。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>空酒杯</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CqIIqgo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"155\" height=\"155\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">可使用此道具清空已充滿的偉大聖杯，進而生成盛滿酒杯。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>盛滿酒杯</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iIaevwT.png\" width=\"157\" height=\"157\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>盛滿酒杯</strong>可用於合成本模組絕大多數的物品。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>鼠人之眼</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_490e3abb-272e-4bfa-bdaf-a920f96c0c8d.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"162\" height=\"162\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>鼠人之眼</strong>由鼠人掉落，可用於多種合成配方。它會發出明亮的光芒……</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>莉茲鱗片</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TFdPnPn.png\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>莉茲鱗片</strong>由本模組生物之一「莉茲」掉落，可作為合成素材。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>輝耀精華</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_d17083f0-31bb-4fff-ad42-e961f752e1e6.gif\" width=\"156\" height=\"156\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>輝耀精華</strong>由小型精華與下界之星合製而成。若在已充滿的偉大聖杯上與其互動，將召喚首領奈瑟曼，混沌建築師。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>輝耀精華</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_2bc474a8-9afa-44b4-bf76-1312e470714a.gif\" width=\"162\" height=\"162\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>混沌精華</strong>由擊敗首領奈瑟曼，<em>混沌建築師</em>後獲得。若在已充滿的偉大聖杯上與其互動，即可啟動武器的能力。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9Z0tDaG.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>大部分武器皆具備被動與主動能力，必須使用混沌精華才能啟用。</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><strong>聖騎士巨劍</strong></h3>\n<br>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_0072e00d-121e-45df-b20e-35dc1b96d004.gif\" width=\"206\" height=\"206\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">散發著失落聖騎士的正義與勇氣。其主動能力賦予持劍者短暫的不死之身，使其能承受最艱難的戰鬥。被動能力會隨時間逐漸恢復生命值，直到達到最大生命值的特定百分比，是持久戰中的可靠武器。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>廓爾克刀</strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_c9a726f1-a911-428b-9982-9cdae20a92a9.png\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">如影般寂靜，如冬般殘酷。其主動能力會暫時提升移動速度，讓持劍者在攻守兩端取得優勢。被動能力允許連續快速攻擊凍結目標，使敵人無法動彈，為後續連擊創造機會。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>釘錘</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_8f524748-0b78-48b0-aa3c-b2a924ab65a2.png\" width=\"206\" height=\"206\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">為敢闖虛無者所持的武器。其主動能力可向前快速衝刺，提供機動性與戰術突襲的機會。被動能力賦予持劍者二段跳的力量，為任何戰鬥增添無與倫比的靈活性。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>科佩什彎刀</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_616ff7b5-81bb-4b92-99fc-2f4edef9e26b.gif\" width=\"223\" height=\"223\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">浴火鍛造，刻劃征服者的命運。其主動能力會在短時間內反彈受到的攻擊，將敵人的力量反噬其身。被動能力有機率在命中時點燃對手，確保每次攻擊都有機會造成持續傷害。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>屠殺之刃</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_0f4b7856-0614-4f6c-85ad-03cb806389bf.png\" width=\"244\" height=\"244\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">揮舞著千名戰士的狂怒。其主動能力可進入狂暴狀態，在有限時間內提升抗性與傷害輸出，在近身戰鬥中極具破壞力。被動能力會增強對高血量敵人的傷害，扭轉與強大敵人的戰局。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>小柄太刀</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_ee220462-f648-43ca-89c7-abae4d4596dc.png\" width=\"208\" height=\"208\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">一把低語著黑暗的古刃。其主動能力強化下一次攻擊，附加黑暗效果並造成大量額外傷害。被動能力會增強對低血量敵人的傷害，使其在終結技時格外致命。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>鋼製武器</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_7738cff2-ddfd-4a94-9748-38a8242bfdeb.png\" width=\"219\" height=\"219\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_85a9b010-d38f-46f5-b641-20004bf0a7dd.png\" width=\"223\" height=\"223\"></span></p>\n<p>鋼製武器，比鐵更堅固。推薦給中階玩家使用。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ULfkRrc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"105\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>薩溫南瓜</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_3e6378c3-07a9-47ee-b0fb-6ea053aaf6b1.png\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_a8590df1-2dcd-4dee-8977-852c4407a5ef.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">一種可以馴服的<em>小南瓜</em>，是不是很可愛？它的主要功能是保護主人，利用裝備給它的武器和護甲來為自己作戰。這表示你可以透過丟在地上讓它撿起的方式，給予它任何類型的護甲與物品。要取回物品，只需按住 Shift 並右鍵點擊即可。它不會自然生成，因此<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">必須按照以下方式召喚</span>：<em>放置一個金塊，上方再放上一盞南瓜燈</em>。要馴服此生物，必須餵食它一顆偉大精華。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>鼠人</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_ddc44fe5-a455-403b-972e-c1c9e8c5daf6.png\" width=\"284\" height=\"309\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_6a4e2e14-3de4-41c6-b694-0239d68d006c.png\" width=\"349\" height=\"314\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">一種小型老鼠，<em>會生成</em>於沙漠、滴石洞窟、叢林與茂密洞穴中。它有特定機率掉落其眼睛——<em>鼠人之眼</em>。它擁有兩項被動能力，其中一項會在生命值降至一半以下時隨機觸發。這些能力包括：向周圍射擊毒箭，或生成煙霧彈讓自己短暫隱形。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>小鬼精靈</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_4f354d3f-b707-41ee-b703-cbb08324ec83.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"318\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_c4678667-cc64-4b97-9334-0a2feb5362ea.png\" width=\"263\" height=\"321\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">這隻小惡魔<em>會生成</em>於地獄，具體來說是在地獄荒原、靈魂沙谷、扭曲森林與緋紅森林。它擁有兩項被動能力，類似鼠人，其中一項會在生命值降至一半以下時觸發。它會進入暴怒狀態以增強自身屬性（如傷害與速度），或召喚 3 隻名為小鬼幽靈的靈異生物在周圍飛舞，使敵人難以近身而不先遭到攻擊。你也可以餵它金錠來分散注意力幾秒鐘，給你足夠的時間脫身。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>幽靈</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_94407758-99ca-4e1e-b216-30b8c6cb8ae6.png\" width=\"293\" height=\"268\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_66dbbfdc-c91a-4fc9-897a-5c1530198cdd.png\" width=\"271\" height=\"261\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">這種幽靈<em>常見於</em>針葉林、森林、茂密洞穴與惡地。它對光線與觸碰非常敏感，容易消失。它的被動能力是：只要它還活著，周圍的敵對生物都會變得無敵，這彷彿是它在前世未能拯救摯愛之後的贖罪方式……</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>腐敗斑塊</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_ce3db72d-1b47-45f4-bfd3-17c0d20317a2.png\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_a90ff25f-7a1c-48c8-8089-18da57e78372.png\" width=\"231\" height=\"284\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">它通常<em>會生成</em>在地獄荒原與叢林中。它喜歡咬人，所以不建議靠得太近……</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>遠古炸彈</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_14d1838c-12b3-4628-8fb2-91ed8fe04365.png\" width=\"202\" height=\"332\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_800a7f2c-a72c-4caf-96d1-82d80ccda86b.png\" width=\"199\" height=\"328\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">一團裝滿火藥的小型金屬塊，<em>經常出現在</em>雪地、針葉林與森林地區。如果靠得太近，它可能會爆炸，但請小心，因為它會留下有毒的痕跡，需要避開。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>遠古騎士</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_39ddbdc0-db09-496d-8312-64c77ea31e20.png\" width=\"342\" height=\"439\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_1e83438b-d334-4411-b762-c175944b176d.png\" width=\"338\" height=\"439\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">與遠古炸彈一同<em>出現</em>在相同生物群系中。這是一個非常強大的生物，造成極高傷害，且毫不猶豫地會攻擊靠得太近的人。當它的生命值降至一半以下時，會召喚數顆遠古炸彈，將玩家推開，並每隔幾秒生成一圈毒霧。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>莉茲</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_25a4202b-bfc8-4c76-ae72-d9c1bc5a0921.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">它<em>會生成</em>於森林、針葉林、沙漠與茂密洞穴中。此生物可掉落莉茲鱗片，作為合成素材。它半盲但聽覺極佳；若靠得太近，它會逃離。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>沼澤人</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_1b8ed8fa-58a7-4f0f-9112-f1c36a81e9ca.png\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_1c4f084c-efde-436a-b4fd-643df4938177.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">此生物<em>可發現於</em>海灘、河岸、叢林與稀疏叢林。它手持斧頭，會用它攻擊靠得太近的人。當它進入狂暴狀態時，會進入第二階段，改為從遠距離投擲斧頭，造成大量傷害。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>小鬼幽靈</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_545ee1e6-966d-4caa-bb85-340698b7c946.png\" width=\"232\" height=\"229\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_26ba6db7-6ace-4250-a578-3b1419510019.png\" width=\"235\" height=\"231\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">當小鬼精靈進入第二階段時，這隻飛行生物會在它們周圍盤旋，這是其被動能力的一部分。它們本身沒有任何用途；受到攻擊時會爆炸並將附近玩家推開。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>奈瑟曼，混沌建築師</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_40c67d88-4546-4282-9cbb-fcaf2db34e16.png\" width=\"188\" height=\"305\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_ea2629cd-51f4-4d04-87a3-150b88d99802.png\" width=\"259\" height=\"300\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_d956bd84-524f-4ffb-b2aa-ab580b3ab498.png\" width=\"174\" height=\"307\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">一個擁有 3 個階段的<strong>首領</strong>。<em>必須</em>在已充滿的偉大聖杯上互動輝耀精華來召喚。每個階段皆擁有獨特的能力，包括凍結攻擊、熔岩傳送等。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/o6tZJFm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"98\"></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">本模組提供多種護甲，每套皆擁有獨立的被動能力。若不想在大型整合包中出現過多物品，可使用專門用於阻止註冊的模組來停用這些護甲。推薦搭配 JEI 模組查看合成配方。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><strong>蘋果與竹製護甲套裝</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_fa09e64e-73ae-47d6-bd03-457c42f91d29.png\" width=\"164\" height=\"221\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_23d4e1bf-51db-44f0-9231-6aca7bbaff49.png\" width=\"261\" height=\"204\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_a04a378e-c82a-4767-9c9d-6792df047606.png\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_5507dcef-84de-4335-bd48-e8d70d3fd4a7.png\" width=\"217\" height=\"205\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><strong>蝙蝠、烈焰人、弓與角護甲套裝</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_0e3fb5cb-c831-445a-b48e-39639bc81be3.png\" width=\"216\" height=\"181\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_f017108c-8a90-4f0d-96f4-ab8f8208c600.png\" width=\"194\" height=\"214\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_07629fc6-ca2a-476d-aa2a-add4fda12dbc.png\" width=\"326\" height=\"197\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_27f7e490-76f1-499f-bb34-72bbe3308829.png\" width=\"229\" height=\"208\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><strong>苦力怕、深板巖、龍與終界衛士護甲套裝</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_9c6cbb78-7179-4f12-b76f-fe7d8694f052.png\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_e4959482-d295-48ac-8622-7d2ed18085bc.png\" width=\"272\" height=\"208\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_91103687-299f-4c92-8d44-09538ab18cb8.png\" width=\"235\" height=\"200\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_4598c7d9-ee0c-44d1-97db-b0579a51561c.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"189\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><strong>奪魂者、冰錐與虛無護甲套裝</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_7f96079d-f6f9-4d02-9387-6b7a517ee43b.png\" width=\"297\" height=\"210\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_711ba87c-ff18-4bed-bed0-149966cc8a7e.png\" width=\"203\" height=\"226\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_ca95bde2-6b26-45cb-88ba-018cd9c07d94.png\" width=\"199\" height=\"235\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><strong>獵犬與地獄護甲套裝</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_7609281b-7340-4936-8df1-acfa3c467d15.png\" width=\"183\" height=\"226\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_8b9ec6ce-d5c3-4411-b762-c175944b176d.png\" width=\"214\" height=\"224\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_baef79cb-62e5-49c3-90fe-4d4923b1355a.png\" width=\"265\" height=\"223\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_7d798cb5-f91e-4a24-be3b-992c21beb8ca.png\" width=\"234\" height=\"222\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><strong>征途、魅影、極地與海洋護甲套裝</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_a50bc58e-b46d-4ddc-a382-e9282f7d893d.png\" width=\"232\" height=\"213\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_6dcf0aa5-4453-498e-aa59-de71b502cd69.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"218\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_b60d2d0d-b341-42ee-be13-8f5add60fcf2.png\" width=\"227\" height=\"220\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_088a3f99-a574-490e-a1f6-a05309fb63e0.png\" width=\"222\" height=\"226\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><strong>盾牌、忍者、銀色與銀魚護甲套裝</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_6fb79808-50fc-4974-b170-9fe41811c509.png\" width=\"187\" height=\"243\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_c8a677ba-dcde-4bfa-b26f-59834cded2f2.png\" width=\"239\" height=\"236\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_94b73416-6896-427f-b94a-001214c1a4b5.png\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_b753fe77-02a9-4332-8443-a061cb030343.png\" width=\"205\" height=\"237\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><strong>骷髏與旱獺護甲套裝</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_cdae6bb6-4822-44c6-b85d-64f703c718eb.png\" width=\"191\" height=\"175\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_028e52d6-c341-4e1c-8835-207ff6224c0.png\" width=\"188\" height=\"175\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_49377a19-02b5-4bf5-96d6-f5c9963ea0cc.png\" width=\"130\" height=\"174\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_8a224882-a06e-4486-8c26-f1e8a2b2e344.png\" width=\"155\" height=\"181\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_333fd229-979e-4e3c-a221-9f0f864a3e20.png\" width=\"208\" height=\"178\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><strong>征服者護甲套裝</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_1c4a173b-61d4-42ea-80b7-5c8df92a3e5d.png\" width=\"286\" height=\"205\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_a5de715a-11a7-4139-a451-c480aeaff5cf.png\" width=\"324\" height=\"207\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_cf6eb5f1-bfbb-4782-a51a-bdfe53650b3c.png\" width=\"171\" height=\"211\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><strong>蜘蛛、松鼠與海盜護甲套裝</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_e7e71470-389c-4a86-bcd0-2807372c36c3.png\" width=\"207\" height=\"194\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_7994cc83-6db8-4b78-9859-0c89166e583e.png\" width=\"173\" height=\"195\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_0f7080ac-3e01-4cb2-bbf3-6b9f2268398c.png\" width=\"186\" height=\"180\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_d8813aec-8363-4a00-a987-c9f6d9ebfff4.png\" width=\"141\" height=\"174\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_4d00bd3d-658e-4222-86ed-518c036d46f7.png\" width=\"189\" height=\"95\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><strong>稻草人、天狗、老兵與女巫護甲套裝</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_9fe400c8-f4ff-4c26-b3a6-a99b98c0ef88.png\" width=\"376\" height=\"178\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_7458a615-5f9b-4b0e-9287-60126bd552b0.png\" width=\"242\" height=\"172\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_c902a6cd-840a-4291-8eed-7320fde98053.png\" width=\"173\" height=\"182\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_c38e6ca8-c02d-4652-a29a-1003c1973dd9.png\" width=\"193\" height=\"175\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><strong>颶風與殭屍護甲套裝</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_ba2bf00f-7742-4525-a238-8e807efccc3d.png\"><img style=\"font-weight: 400;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_a7a6c505-da84-4bd0-a1ba-a11de857ab95.png\" width=\"321\" height=\"205\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_2bac647e-ff08-4ffc-bc60-dcc37ba80617.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"209\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B2Zjlf5.png\" width=\"75%\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/count_grimhart/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Count Grimhart</a> 是大部分美術作品的創作者，授權條款為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knight-quest#license\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">C